<div n="1" type="jReadersLetters">             <head>                <hi rendition="#b">Brie&#x017F;ka&#x017F;ten.</hi>             </head>             <lb/>
<div n="2" type="jArticle">                <head>                   <hi rendition="#b">O. Sch.</hi>                </head>                 <p>Sie wundern &#x017F;ich, daß das angedrohte &#x201E;Duell<lb/>
